{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46   二期生   宮崎県出身\nまつりちゃんこと松田里奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いていただきありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobm6GfHt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日！6月10日！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single\n｢Lonesome rabbit/What's “KAZOKU”?｣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "無事発売しましたーーー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初の両A面シングル！\nLonesome rabbitの激ムズな振り付けや｢夜桜さんちの大作戦｣第2期のオープニングテーマをやらせていただいたり、色々！\n新しい事にまだまだ挑戦させていただけるなんて、すごく幸せですね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また新しい櫻坂46に出会えて私は嬉しいです♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに、収録曲の中で印象に残ったのは｢恵まれ過ぎて｣ですかね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やればやるほど自信をなくすのは、成長したからこそ、周りが見えるようになるからこそなのかなと思ったり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夢中な時は何も気づいてなかったなって思うし"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして気づいたら足がすくみそうな所にいて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いっぱいグルグル考えて、答えが出ない時もあるけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "｢でも 迷った時にはいつも 君は君のままでいいよって 日差しのように温かく背中を押すあなたがいる｣\nっていう歌詞があるように"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっぱりBuddiesが、ずっと温かくそばにいてくれて、道標になってくれるから今もこれからも進んでいけるなって思います！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だから私もBuddiesの背中を日差しのように温かく押せる人でありたいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesには櫻坂がついてますからね！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Singleも素敵な楽曲がたくさんあります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しでも多くの方に届きますように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single期間もよろしくお願いします！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobGlNvtg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "‪𓂃 𓈒𓏸◌‬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんとありがたいことに今回も発売を記念して、全国のCD SHOPでパネル展示を行っていただいています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全国のCD SHOP・量販店さんいつもありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな中で今回もSHIBUYA TSUTAYAさんにお邪魔させていただきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobGSsG0E.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobgWwUWB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "パネル展示実施店舗はこちらです！\nhttps://www.sonymusic.co.jp/Music/Info/sakurazaka46/shoplist/260610-2/"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひお近くのCD SHOP・量販店に足を運んでみてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この後、20:00〜は生配信！\nYouTubeでリリース